  "body": "As part of defining DNS cache partitioning, we could integrate https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-west-let-localhost-be-localhost into Fetch, so at least it's a requirement for browsers.\r\n\r\n@youennf are there any Apple-specific concerns with this plan? I'm not sure where you all are at with this.\r\n\r\ncc @fred-wang",
